[24.798,"o","\u001b[2m# an opencode agent driving grr — reasoning + tool calls, plain text\u001b[0m\n"]
[26.272,"i","opencode run \"Use the grr CLI to show what it can do. Use grr's own JSON output for everything. 1) Run grr transport to show the negotiated transport and runtime features. 2) Run grr ask \"show my unread messages\" to see how natural language resolves to a typed method and params. 3) Run grr gmail users messages list --user-id me --dry-run to print the exact request JSON the API would receive. One short line of explanation after each step.\""]
